{"3299810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GAMBA", "steam_appid": 3299810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble to reach the money threshold for each round. You have three chances to gamble. If you can't win enough money by the end of round, the content addict Cat will play a one-sided russian roulette with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are five games in which you can double the money:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Slot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Blackjack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Roullete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Apendawn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mineswapper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase jokers at the end of each round. Jokers can manipulate anything to your advantage in various ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creating new winable conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Changing the possibilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Doubling your prizes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Manipulating the game loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does <strong>NOT</strong> contain real gambling or use real money.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble to reach the money threshold for each round. You have three chances to gamble. If you can't win enough money by the end of round, the content addict Cat will play a one-sided russian roulette with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are five games in which you can double the money:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Slot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Blackjack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Roullete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Apendawn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mineswapper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase jokers at the end of each round. J